00:13:55.379 --> 00:14:02.670
In most cases the LCSS information is not
changing on the daily basis, however errors

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:08.019
that people make in the LCSS could be updated
at any time.

00:14:08.019 --> 00:14:14.939
Having that update cycle, and also having
the inclusion of content on a regular basis,

00:14:14.939 --> 00:14:16.579
allows us to keep up-to-date.

00:14:16.579 --> 00:14:21.920
And other changes that are made within the
information enterprise.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:26.970
As new information content is made available,
it gets added and we can access that additional

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:28.269
information content.

00:14:28.269 --> 00:14:30.869
